{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:11:41Z","created_by_operation":"op_95fd402594224ac5bc99c1003ebd3761","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_12b12a29348f7fb85d5c9a11a5313809641404c1a9b2e2a44bb2f534482a9ade","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"nasiko-labs/nasiko@ff3d89bf0789 snapshot 7860197f8ac0b7db","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_55ef35d57e55f20ef6e4d88d9053c01a064f30bbd24216b766b749081830bd06"],"source_ids":["src_02241ac6d72c551c87c8ecf3a88338c4"],"text":"The workspace is organized into crates including server (Axum control plane), orchestrator (routing engine), mcp-gateway, llm-router, runtime (Docker via bollard), flow, secrets, oci, observability, agent-proxy, github, types, config, cli, and ui.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:11:41Z","updated_by_operation":"op_95fd402594224ac5bc99c1003ebd3761"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:11:41Z","created_by_operation":"op_95fd402594224ac5bc99c1003ebd3761","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1b45d094ec6a6103c388659e7748d978bcd19224492a050dbf064fc43ee0f181","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=relevance","setting":"nasiko-labs/nasiko@ff3d89bf0789 snapshot 7860197f8ac0b7db","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_590a8b39e5e05bb00ee9a2f8dc41ab8ba7cf6e22f35227de605a95585cae729c","slc_5a3bc2f516c755cd0becc37b589750fa6603b8b67e709865e048c1fde8b2b235"],"source_ids":["src_02241ac6d72c551c87c8ecf3a88338c4"],"text":"Nasiko is relevant to teams operating multiple A2A-speaking agents in any language (Python, Rust, Go, TypeScript), addressing who-calls-whom, key custody, cost, and failure visibility.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:11:41Z","updated_by_operation":"op_95fd402594224ac5bc99c1003ebd3761"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:11:41Z","created_by_operation":"op_95fd402594224ac5bc99c1003ebd3761","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1bb48b93e81f236792a3a790891aec3fcc098619860dae307f968741aef32415","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"nasiko-labs/nasiko@ff3d89bf0789 snapshot 7860197f8ac0b7db","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_d30066a88cc830aebc13ebde33b3800c8e5cb7b1e13824d237b5ca0803d97020","slc_f2990aabbe3542fc8887129bbbcea4605e6f059797ee3aef7afe8c52205c335e"],"source_ids":["src_02241ac6d72c551c87c8ecf3a88338c4","src_ede8cb603af95b5eab98765b8d70864f"],"text":"The A2A implementation uses the Rust libraries a2a-lf 0.3.0 and a2a-server-lf 0.4.0 from a2aproject/a2a-rs, and the workspace targets Rust edition 2024 (Rust 1.85+).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:11:41Z","updated_by_operation":"op_95fd402594224ac5bc99c1003ebd3761"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:11:41Z","created_by_operation":"op_95fd402594224ac5bc99c1003ebd3761","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3263f4b7a2da679301a692afadfd27462630b41094f69ae64e45e1b62ca20d2e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"nasiko-labs/nasiko@ff3d89bf0789 snapshot 7860197f8ac0b7db","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_708fa15e757cbdf7922158860f2c0b7199a3d95f60a7eb73faac7cefc828b0dd"],"source_ids":["src_ede8cb603af95b5eab98765b8d70864f"],"text":"Agent discovery fetches the agent card from /.well-known/agent-card.json on deploy or seed; the orchestrator primarily uses SendStreamingMessage while the CLI uses SendMessage for direct chat.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:11:41Z","updated_by_operation":"op_95fd402594224ac5bc99c1003ebd3761"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:11:41Z","created_by_operation":"op_95fd402594224ac5bc99c1003ebd3761","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6dc4343205ffc3eb4dbc1b1fa56d3131616aed180c87bb0da1e70e0c1b06b474","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"nasiko-labs/nasiko@ff3d89bf0789 snapshot 7860197f8ac0b7db","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_41e528f0c4a9293a86d16f5ccc80fe0297e786bbc630f029ec569960a89bba3e","slc_defb902029ca95c5c7c19aaaa8030770b1d16b8139c37adc20d2c7ed765e2899"],"source_ids":["src_02241ac6d72c551c87c8ecf3a88338c4"],"text":"The server exposes a REST API for agents, builds, and uploads, plus an embedded OCI Distribution v2 registry at /v2/*, an MCP Gateway exposing tools/list and tools/call, and an OpenAI-compatible LLM router egress.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:11:41Z","updated_by_operation":"op_95fd402594224ac5bc99c1003ebd3761"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:11:41Z","created_by_operation":"op_95fd402594224ac5bc99c1003ebd3761","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_79111a9bb7304a63b57e096898b1987d80c890b92f0490593f01fc1263afccfc","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"nasiko-labs/nasiko@ff3d89bf0789 snapshot 7860197f8ac0b7db","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_b77f55f61ea1ef6c69bcb03ccd233dd25e4419a6ca27fa727ecb5522d0ee3aa9","slc_daf5564f483d1d04db6b04326b974198c5f94f751039d6c1745b98006225f2ec"],"source_ids":["src_02241ac6d72c551c87c8ecf3a88338c4"],"text":"Configuration is env-driven through a single Config struct; SECRETS_ENCRYPTION_KEY and JWT_SECRET are required, OPENAI_API_KEY and COMPOSIO_API_KEY are optional, and required keys fail fast at startup.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:11:41Z","updated_by_operation":"op_95fd402594224ac5bc99c1003ebd3761"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:11:41Z","created_by_operation":"op_95fd402594224ac5bc99c1003ebd3761","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7dc90679844c867a1c2641a58e1f24e27b6156a58dba393bd4d060df644fb4ca","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"nasiko-labs/nasiko@ff3d89bf0789 snapshot 7860197f8ac0b7db","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_defb902029ca95c5c7c19aaaa8030770b1d16b8139c37adc20d2c7ed765e2899"],"source_ids":["src_02241ac6d72c551c87c8ecf3a88338c4"],"text":"Per-agent secrets are AES-256-GCM encrypted at rest and injected only at deploy time; flow guards backed by Redis enforce cascade limits for depth, fan-out, token budget, timeout, and cycle detection.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:11:41Z","updated_by_operation":"op_95fd402594224ac5bc99c1003ebd3761"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:11:41Z","created_by_operation":"op_95fd402594224ac5bc99c1003ebd3761","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a1ad42a39ee764f0072ecba34c33d3c6621d5adba3b134d3194d4ea7e55bfdc8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"nasiko-labs/nasiko@ff3d89bf0789 snapshot 7860197f8ac0b7db","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4f8408c2cc2f7532980f03c61fd2f336cd0bcb75ec94a49c448cc9f93e0b1382","slc_8905670c2689245e8129ba5c60bd32e17c241a88198f508c598e55211a1dceab","slc_a93ea17aa81fc3e33f4dc079f3269fa9eebba19beacf41e603bb38b18a1b4a8b","slc_ff04e7a710abd79bf9f2bcc2c833effc02b2d1691936c2efe64ed3a00bfa1142"],"source_ids":["src_02241ac6d72c551c87c8ecf3a88338c4"],"text":"Repository development practice: the developer path (Path B) requires Rust, just, and Docker; just infra starts backing services, just dev runs the server with hot-reload via cargo-watch, and just run runs without hot-reload.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:11:41Z","updated_by_operation":"op_95fd402594224ac5bc99c1003ebd3761"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:11:41Z","created_by_operation":"op_95fd402594224ac5bc99c1003ebd3761","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_abc1c8bb5c0c2338ec7bae3aee935b00e339afb37c248c5499b3b664cdc8f37d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"nasiko-labs/nasiko@ff3d89bf0789 snapshot 7860197f8ac0b7db","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_d30066a88cc830aebc13ebde33b3800c8e5cb7b1e13824d237b5ca0803d97020"],"source_ids":["src_02241ac6d72c551c87c8ecf3a88338c4"],"text":"Agents speaking pre-1.0 A2A spec versions (e.g. 0.2.x, 0.3.0) are rejected with error -32009 VersionNotSupported.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:11:41Z","updated_by_operation":"op_95fd402594224ac5bc99c1003ebd3761"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:11:41Z","created_by_operation":"op_95fd402594224ac5bc99c1003ebd3761","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b03237d243ceeca5593f03b0dadb575d909648f8484b61e3cbca7f72b39a1f6c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"nasiko-labs/nasiko@ff3d89bf0789 snapshot 7860197f8ac0b7db","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_ca07edab358cdc9c414dfd9f9b8e9843d53f3bb88d484548db39cb8935cdc3df"],"source_ids":["src_02241ac6d72c551c87c8ecf3a88338c4"],"text":"The nasiko CLI provides commands for connect, auth login, new, build/run, push/deploy, upload, ps, logs, lifecycle (stop/start/restart/scale), chat, secrets, mcp, observe, maf, registry, and github.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:11:41Z","updated_by_operation":"op_95fd402594224ac5bc99c1003ebd3761"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:11:41Z","created_by_operation":"op_95fd402594224ac5bc99c1003ebd3761","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b6f26b39a265eb4f5c78fefdd014eb24cfb55188a3b6a8fa54176736299531a7","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"nasiko-labs/nasiko@ff3d89bf0789 snapshot 7860197f8ac0b7db","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9a26584c3054b8c3c7d224a6063e51db9a2fc0da6099de9fa4b41f01f15b5cb4","slc_defb902029ca95c5c7c19aaaa8030770b1d16b8139c37adc20d2c7ed765e2899"],"source_ids":["src_02241ac6d72c551c87c8ecf3a88338c4"],"text":"Agents never receive direct public requests and never hold real API keys or tool credentials; they call back into the LLM Router via OPENAI_BASE_URL and the MCP Gateway instead.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:11:41Z","updated_by_operation":"op_95fd402594224ac5bc99c1003ebd3761"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:11:41Z","created_by_operation":"op_95fd402594224ac5bc99c1003ebd3761","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_cfbe836b4e27a784884c35eff97c603159a36c39fef07400c1ec81524d9d52e6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"nasiko-labs/nasiko@ff3d89bf0789 snapshot 7860197f8ac0b7db","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6389c1e0987cea820d2b62f00ae80fe832e07b2209be5670018f569f79e5c79e","slc_f3166e033836725e2106cc29220f16c4423a76f5a9f7283f8626fc7b01768afb"],"source_ids":["src_02241ac6d72c551c87c8ecf3a88338c4"],"text":"Durable state lives in Postgres, Redis, and S3 (RustFS), with optional observability via Tempo, Loki, and the OTel Collector; the Docker-only quick start starts this full stack.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:11:41Z","updated_by_operation":"op_95fd402594224ac5bc99c1003ebd3761"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:11:41Z","created_by_operation":"op_95fd402594224ac5bc99c1003ebd3761","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d542a425b9ffaa8c2a16be5a6d61c682cedd5358b42d12cc4a64931977991860","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"nasiko-labs/nasiko@ff3d89bf0789 snapshot 7860197f8ac0b7db","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_defb902029ca95c5c7c19aaaa8030770b1d16b8139c37adc20d2c7ed765e2899"],"source_ids":["src_02241ac6d72c551c87c8ecf3a88338c4"],"text":"The routing engine uses a 3-stage pipeline: shortlisting agents by embedding similarity, reranking on conversation context, then an LLM final pick, so callers need not know the fleet.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:11:41Z","updated_by_operation":"op_95fd402594224ac5bc99c1003ebd3761"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:11:41Z","created_by_operation":"op_95fd402594224ac5bc99c1003ebd3761","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d77ebb8a6fb05d87f6e6e50ceaacb6202e6252664608576c0ae95ae9388a9647","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"nasiko-labs/nasiko@ff3d89bf0789 snapshot 7860197f8ac0b7db","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6389c1e0987cea820d2b62f00ae80fe832e07b2209be5670018f569f79e5c79e","slc_f30138a9b855c034dfb8c944442f17dc88eee110f615ae940371b994751c5321","slc_f7eea25d979712d3ea9f40561a17f825fb97b385c25352d9bddacbe5dbbdf144"],"source_ids":["src_02241ac6d72c551c87c8ecf3a88338c4","src_ede8cb603af95b5eab98765b8d70864f"],"text":"Nasiko runs as a single control-plane process with no separate gateway; every inter-agent call is proxied back through the server, which enforces flow limits, ACLs, and observability at one chokepoint.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:11:41Z","updated_by_operation":"op_95fd402594224ac5bc99c1003ebd3761"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:11:41Z","created_by_operation":"op_95fd402594224ac5bc99c1003ebd3761","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_da0d11ccb87143e4d56035e52b88cd92531e2fc16f685d481a7340ac4e1a9bfb","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"nasiko-labs/nasiko@ff3d89bf0789 snapshot 7860197f8ac0b7db","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_55f0f347bba5a33f016e771f46e2617b7125b1affef3e86a2bc137f5633af5e4","slc_d30066a88cc830aebc13ebde33b3800c8e5cb7b1e13824d237b5ca0803d97020","slc_d7c3deee11b705683f034a9d0330272918545422ed348bf3009a06847dde4218"],"source_ids":["src_02241ac6d72c551c87c8ecf3a88338c4","src_ede8cb603af95b5eab98765b8d70864f"],"text":"Nasiko targets the A2A protocol v1.0 exactly, requiring the A2A-Version: 1.0 header on every request, and uses JSON-RPC 2.0 over HTTP(S) as its sole protocol binding with SSE for streaming.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:11:41Z","updated_by_operation":"op_95fd402594224ac5bc99c1003ebd3761"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:11:41Z","created_by_operation":"op_95fd402594224ac5bc99c1003ebd3761","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f16bd83311e5233dd94af1465287283ce2b761f1d7369c136e668cb2d1e241be","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"nasiko-labs/nasiko@ff3d89bf0789 snapshot 7860197f8ac0b7db","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c3b005a4ebdb9d2e9729caeb4e3bb9780d0ef5b75960dd909279b01b32cc4606"],"source_ids":["src_02241ac6d72c551c87c8ecf3a88338c4"],"text":"Repository development practice: contributors use just recipes — just check (cargo check), just clippy with a zero-warnings policy, just test-unit for hermetic unit tests, and just test for unit plus integration tests requiring just infra.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:11:41Z","updated_by_operation":"op_95fd402594224ac5bc99c1003ebd3761"}
